<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A3.SS2" title="In Appendix C Benchmark and score details ‣ Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C.2 </span>Score Metrics</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Implementation Details</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Input and Output examples</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS1" title="In Appendix E Input and Output examples ‣ Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.1 </span>Visual Search</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS2" title="In Appendix E Input and Output examples ‣ Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.2 </span>Counting</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A5.SS3" title="In Appendix E Input and Output examples ‣ Visual Structures Helps Visual Reasoning: Addressing the Binding Problem in VLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E.3 </span>Scene Description</span></a></li>
